<title>UK: AFDB sets 10 bln yen dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>AFDB sets 10 bln yen dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Yamaichi.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AFRICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON    *3.192     MATURITY    17.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE DUAL-CURRENCY   ISS PRICE  100.35    PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AA+   DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR DEBT, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>	     *PAYABLE IN US DOLLARS WITH REDEMPTION IN YEN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
